  "Software Details": "Softwaredetails",
  "The Checkout Attachment Module for eCommerceGo introduces a streamlined way for customers to add attachments during the checkout process. This module empowers customers to include essential documents or files related to their orders, such as design specifications, proof of identity, or personalized instructions. By allowing attachments at checkout, the module enhances the clarity and accuracy of orders, ensuring that all necessary information is captured upfront.": "Das Checkout-Anhangsmodul für eCommerceGo bietet Kunden eine optimierte Möglichkeit, Anhänge während des Bezahlvorgangs hinzuzufügen. ",
  "View Live Demo": "Live-Demo ansehen",
  "Intuitive Attachment Process for Customers": "Intuitiver Anlageprozess für Kunden",
  "Designed with user experience in mind, the Checkout Attachment Module makes adding attachments a straightforward and hassle-free process. During checkout, customers are presented with an easy-to-use interface to upload their files. Supported file types and size limits can be configured to suit your business needs, ensuring compatibility and efficiency. This user-friendly approach helps reduce friction in the checkout process, leading to higher customer satisfaction and fewer order discrepancies.": "Das Checkout-Anhangsmodul wurde unter Berücksichtigung der Benutzererfahrung entwickelt und macht das Hinzufügen von Anhängen zu einem unkomplizierten und problemlosen Vorgang. ",
  "Enhanced Communication with Administrators": "Verbesserte Kommunikation mit Administratoren",
  "Once a customer adds an attachment, it becomes immediately visible to the admin on the backend. This feature is particularly useful for businesses that require additional documentation to process orders accurately. Admins can easily access, review, and manage these attachments through the eCommerceGo admin panel. This seamless integration ensures that all relevant information is at the admin fingertips, facilitating smoother order processing and better customer service.": "Sobald ein Kunde einen Anhang hinzufügt, wird dieser sofort für den Administrator im Backend sichtbar. ",
  "Customer Transparency and Access": "Kundentransparenz und -zugang",
  "Transparency is a key benefit of the Checkout Attachment Module. Customers can view their uploaded attachments directly from the frontend, providing reassurance that their additional information has been successfully received and recorded. This visibility helps build trust and confidence in the purchasing process, as customers can verify that their special requests or required documents are in place. The ability to review attachments post-checkout also reduces the likelihood of follow-up queries, saving time for both customers and support teams.": "Transparenz ist ein wesentlicher Vorteil des Checkout-Anhangsmoduls. ",
